---
// Ceremonias Mayas — real photo background from public/
---

<section id="ceremonias" class="section ceremonias-section">
  <div class="ceremonias-bg">
    <img
      src="/ceremonia.jpg"
      alt="Ceremonia maya en el cenote"
      class="ceremonias-bg-img"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="ceremonias-bg-overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ceremonias-content">
    <div class="ceremonias-text fade-up">
      <h2 class="ceremonias-title">La Ceremonia de tus Sueños</h2>
      <p class="ceremonias-desc">
        Vive una ceremonia maya auténtica en el corazón del cenote.
        Un sacerdote maya guiará la experiencia con rituales ancestrales,
        sahumerios de copal y ofrendas sagradas que conectan el mundo terrenal con el inframundo.
      </p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/529995085367?text=Hola,%20quiero%20consultar%20disponibilidad%20para%20una%20ceremonia%20maya" class="cta-btn cta-btn--filled ceremonias-cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span>Consultar disponibilidad</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ceremonias-section {
    position: relative; width: 100%; min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ceremonias-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
  }
  .ceremonias-bg-img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .ceremonias-bg-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(13, 11, 8, 0.65);
  }
  .ceremonias-content {
    position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; max-width: 700px;
    padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 200px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 80px);
  }
  .ceremonias-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px); color: var(--color-gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .ceremonias-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 300; font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-limestone); opacity: 0.75; line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 580px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
  }
  .ceremonias-cta { margin: 0 auto; }
</style>
